Subject: [PATCH] Regenerate indexes for the selected kernel module initrd

The runtime module indexes include modules excluded from the initrd. Copy the
selected files into private workspace, regenerate their native indexes, and
preserve the original runtime tree. Test real kmod alias resolution, source
identity, cleanup, public directory modes, and reproducible output.

